# A family: {N} takes the values 0 to 7 (8 runs).
# The enemies' choice between two players: Axel (player 1) and Blaze (player 2) walk right
# together until a Galsia comes out, then Axel {N} ticks more; the Galsias go after one of them
# (the nearer across; player 2 on a tie, N = 0), and the other when that one is down.
start axel blaze
until state 1 ready
until state 2 ready
pad 1
+right
pad 2
+right
until state galsia !appear within 300
-right
wait {N}
pad 1
-right
wait 300
